      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the villa door, Muranishi puts on dark sunglasses to greet his American star—only to mistake her manager for the actress herself. Meanwhile in Tokyo, Toshi presses Kawada on how he raised the travel money. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
